<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Hocheng 1st-half net down 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Hocheng 1st-half net down 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    2,398 vs 3,139</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 339 vs   578</p>
<p>    Net profit			    317 vs   550</p>
<p>NOTE - Hocheng Corp is Taiwan's largest sanitaryware maker. The company attributed both the sales and profit declines to an industry slowdown.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
